	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Vishay RCL1225 e3 long-side-termination thick film chip resistor, 2W, 3.2 x 6.3 x 0.70mm. Reverse geometry - the terminations run along the 6.3mm side, which is what allows 2W in this size. Manufacturer reflow land: 1.60 x 6.60mm pads on a 1.20mm gap, 4.40mm span. This is NOT KiCad's R_1225_3264Metric, which is a generic IPC-7351 1225 with 21% less pad area and no 3D model; for a part rated on conduction through its terminations the manufacturer land is the one the rating assumes. Series land pattern - the value is set by the order number, e.g. RCL122520R0FKEG for 20R 1%")
